    "title": "Man convicted of aggravated assault gets case overturned - NewsBreak",
    "text": "Madison County Journal\nwebsite\nMadison County, Mississippi\nMan convicted of aggravated assault gets case overturned\nBy Editorials,\n23 hours agoThe Mississippi Court of Appeals has overturned the aggravated assault conviction of a Madison County man, ruling that a defective indictment voided his guilty plea. In a decision dated July 29, 2025, the court reversed a lower court's ruling and set aside the conviction and 20-year sentence of Frank Strickland, who pleaded guilty in August 2023 to the aggravated assault of LaVada Strickland.",
